<title>USA: Esquire says concludes deal to buy firm.</title>
<headline>Esquire says concludes deal to buy firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esquire Communications Ltd said Monday it has concluded its agreement to buy the assets of Krauss, Katz &amp; Ackerman Inc in Philadelphia.</p>
<p>The company did not provide information on the purchase price.</p>
<p>Krauss, Katz provides deposition and court reporting services to the Philadelphia legal community.</p>
<p>Esquire provides court reporting and related legal support services.</p>
</text>
